Generic cloud AI drops safety interlocks and hallucinates fifty-five Newton meters instead of thirty-five—risking catastrophic blowout.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,200
Cloud AI is dead out here. Meet MECH-G.

4
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:37,000
Snap: Gemma vision identifies the valve offline. Lock: OSHA safety gate verifies zero energy. Fix: Calibrated thirty-five Newton meters, backed by exact citations.

5
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:47,000
Eighty-four percent faster repair. Sub-five-hundred millisecond local graph latency. MECH-G: Mission-critical edge intelligence.
